+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; img-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; script-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; font-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-notice">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>This notice covers this static website. Updated October 28, 2026.</p>
+    <h2>Browse without sharing extra information</h2>
+    <p>These pages do not ask for personal information and use no cookies, browser storage, analytics, advertising trackers, or client-side scripts. Images and styles are served by this website, so loading a page does not request assets from third-party websites.</p>
+    <h2>Connection information</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends connection information, including your IP address and the requested URL, to the hosting provider to deliver the page. The hosting provider may record access or security logs. This website does not control those logs. Avoid putting personal or sensitive information in URLs.</p>
+    <h2>Accounts, rewards, and orders</h2>
+    <p>This static website does not process account details, rewards information, payments, or orders. Links to those services are navigation placeholders. Do not submit passwords or payment information through this website.</p>
+    <h2>Third parties and your choices</h2>
+    <p>The coffee photograph is hosted locally. No embedded third-party services receive data from these pages. You do not need to accept tracking cookies to browse, and there is no site-managed personal data or browser storage to delete.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
